7.12 UI Consistency Checklist

Before merging UI updates:

 All panels use same padding (16px)

 Font color matches theme

 Buttons have hover state

 No absolute positioning unless essential

 Scrollbars styled for both OS themes

 High contrast mode tested

 No duplicated Tailwind classes

7.13 Asset Management

Assets (icons, logos, images) stored under:

/assets/
 ├── icons/
 ├── logos/
